cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "invdx"
abstract: >-
  A photonic inverse-design toolbox combining a fast GPU FDTD engine (FDTDX)
  with an independent, authoritative cross-validation engine (Meep) behind
  one config-driven, validation-gated methodology layer. Includes a
  six-gate validation framework, fabrication-robustness utilities, and an
  adjoint-based inverse-design driver for a photonic grating coupler.
type: software
